    "1. Edit ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: turn on a Gmail account or GitHub, and paste the Bark device key. In the Bark app, set Push Encryption to AES256 / GCM / noPadding with the encryption_key from the file." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Bearbeite ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: Aktiviere ein Gmail-Konto oder GitHub und füge den Bark-Geräteschlüssel ein. Stelle in der Bark-App die Push-Verschlüsselung (Push Encryption) mit dem encryption_key aus der Datei auf AES256 / GCM / noPadding."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Edit ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: turn on a Gmail account or GitHub, and paste the Bark device key. In the Bark app, set Push Encryption to AES256 / GCM / noPadding with the encryption_key from the file."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Edita ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: activa una cuenta de Gmail o GitHub y pega la clave de dispositivo de Bark. En la app Bark, configura el cifrado push (Push Encryption) como AES256 / GCM / noPadding con el encryption_key del archivo."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. I-edit ang ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: i-on ang isang Gmail account o GitHub, at i-paste ang Bark device key. Sa Bark app, itakda ang Push Encryption sa AES256 / GCM / noPadding gamit ang encryption_key mula sa file."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Modifiez ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml : activez un compte Gmail ou GitHub, puis collez la clé d’appareil Bark. Dans l’app Bark, réglez le chiffrement push (Push Encryption) sur AES256 / GCM / noPadding avec l’encryption_key du fichier."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Uredite ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: uključite Gmail račun ili GitHub i zalijepite ključ uređaja za Bark. U aplikaciji Bark postavite šifriranje push obavijesti (Push Encryption) na AES256 / GCM / noPadding s ključem encryption_key iz datoteke."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Edit ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: aktifkan akun Gmail atau GitHub, lalu tempel kunci perangkat Bark. Di app Bark, atur enkripsi push (Push Encryption) ke AES256 / GCM / noPadding dengan encryption_key dari file tersebut."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml を編集して、Gmail アカウントまたは GitHub をオンにし、Bark のデバイス鍵を貼り付けてください。Bark アプリで、ファイル内の encryption_key を使ってプッシュ暗号化（Push Encryption）を AES256 / GCM / noPadding に設定してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml을 편집하여 Gmail 계정 또는 GitHub를 켜고 Bark 기기 키를 붙여 넣으세요. Bark 앱에서 파일의 encryption_key로 푸시 암호화(Push Encryption)를 AES256 / GCM / noPadding으로 설정하세요."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Edit ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: hidupkan akaun Gmail atau GitHub, dan tampal kunci peranti Bark. Dalam apl Bark, tetapkan penyulitan push (Push Encryption) kepada AES256 / GCM / noPadding dengan encryption_key daripada fail itu."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Edytuj ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: włącz konto Gmail lub GitHub i wklej klucz urządzenia Bark. W aplikacji Bark ustaw szyfrowanie push (Push Encryption) na AES256 / GCM / noPadding z kluczem encryption_key z pliku."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Edite ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: ative uma conta do Gmail ou o GitHub e cole a chave de dispositivo do Bark. No app Bark, defina a criptografia push (Push Encryption) como AES256 / GCM / noPadding com o encryption_key do arquivo."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Editați ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: activați un cont Gmail sau GitHub și lipiți cheia de dispozitiv Bark. În aplicația Bark, setați criptarea push (Push Encryption) la AES256 / GCM / noPadding cu encryption_key din fișier."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Отредактируйте ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: включите аккаунт Gmail или GitHub и вставьте ключ устройства Bark. В приложении Bark установите для шифрования push (Push Encryption) значение AES256 / GCM / noPadding с encryption_key из файла."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. แก้ไข ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml: เปิดบัญชี Gmail หรือ GitHub แล้ววางคีย์อุปกรณ์ Bark ในแอป Bark ให้ตั้งค่าการเข้ารหัสพุช (Push Encryption) เป็น AES256 / GCM / noPadding โดยใช้ encryption_key จากไฟล์"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml dosyasını düzenleyin: Bir Gmail hesabını veya GitHub'ı açın ve Bark aygıt anahtarını yapıştırın. Bark uygulamasında anlık bildirim şifrelemesini (Push Encryption), dosyadaki encryption_key ile AES256 / GCM / noPadding olarak ayarlayın."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 编辑 ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml：开启一个 Gmail 账户或 GitHub，并粘贴 Bark 设备密钥。在 Bark App 中，用文件中的 encryption_key 将推送加密（Push Encryption）设为 AES256 / GCM / noPadding。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 編輯 ~/.minis/hostd/config.toml：開啟一個 Gmail 帳號或 GitHub，並貼上 Bark 裝置金鑰。在 Bark App 中，用檔案中的 encryption_key 將推播加密（Push Encryption）設為 AES256 / GCM / noPadding。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
