    "Add this key to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys on the host, for example by running the copied install command there. The private key stays in this device's Keychain and is not synced." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Füge diesen Schlüssel zu ~/.ssh/authorized_keys auf dem Host hinzu, zum Beispiel indem du dort den kopierten Installationsbefehl ausführst. Der private Schlüssel bleibt im Schlüsselbund dieses Geräts und wird nicht synchronisiert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add this key to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys on the host, for example by running the copied install command there. The private key stays in this device's Keychain and is not synced."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Añade esta clave a ~/.ssh/authorized_keys en el host, por ejemplo ejecutando allí el comando de instalación copiado. La clave privada se queda en el llavero de este dispositivo y no se sincroniza."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Idagdag ang key na ito sa ~/.ssh/authorized_keys ng host, halimbawa sa pagpapatakbo roon ng nakopyang install command. Nananatili ang private key sa Keychain ng device na ito at hindi sini-sync."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajoutez cette clé à ~/.ssh/authorized_keys sur l’hôte, par exemple en y exécutant la commande d’installation copiée. La clé privée reste dans le trousseau de cet appareil et n’est pas synchronisée."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dodajte ovaj ključ u ~/.ssh/authorized_keys na hostu, na primjer tako da ondje pokrenete kopiranu naredbu za instalaciju. Privatni ključ ostaje u privjesku ključeva ovog uređaja i ne sinkronizira se."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tambahkan kunci ini ke ~/.ssh/authorized_keys di host, misalnya dengan menjalankan perintah instal yang disalin di sana. Kunci privat tetap ada di Rantai Kunci perangkat ini dan tidak disinkronkan."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この鍵をホストの ~/.ssh/authorized_keys に追加してください。たとえば、コピーしたインストールコマンドをホストで実行します。秘密鍵はこのデバイスのキーチェーンに残り、同期されません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 키를 호스트의 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys에 추가하세요. 예를 들어 복사한 설치 명령을 호스트에서 실행하면 됩니다. 개인 키는 이 기기의 키체인에 남으며 동기화되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tambah kunci ini ke ~/.ssh/authorized_keys pada hos, contohnya dengan menjalankan arahan pemasangan yang disalin di sana. Kunci peribadi kekal dalam Rantai Kunci peranti ini dan tidak disegerakkan."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dodaj ten klucz do ~/.ssh/authorized_keys na hoście, na przykład uruchamiając tam skopiowane polecenie instalacji. Klucz prywatny zostaje w pęku kluczy tego urządzenia i nie jest synchronizowany."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adicione esta chave a ~/.ssh/authorized_keys no host, por exemplo executando lá o comando de instalação copiado. A chave privada fica no Keychain deste dispositivo e não é sincronizada."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adăugați această cheie în ~/.ssh/authorized_keys pe gazdă, de exemplu rulând acolo comanda de instalare copiată. Cheia privată rămâne în Portchei pe acest dispozitiv și nu se sincronizează."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Добавьте этот ключ в ~/.ssh/authorized_keys на хосте, например выполнив там скопированную команду установки. Закрытый ключ остаётся в связке ключей этого устройства и не синхронизируется."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เพิ่มคีย์นี้ลงใน ~/.ssh/authorized_keys บนโฮสต์ เช่น โดยรันคำสั่งติดตั้งที่คัดลอกไว้บนโฮสต์ คีย์ส่วนตัวยังอยู่ในพวงกุญแจของอุปกรณ์นี้และไม่ซิงค์"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu anahtarı ana makinedeki ~/.ssh/authorized_keys dosyasına ekleyin; örneğin kopyalanan yükleme komutunu orada çalıştırarak. Özel anahtar bu aygıtın Anahtar Zinciri'nde kalır ve eşzamanlanmaz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请将此密钥添加到主机上的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys，例如在主机上运行拷贝的安装命令。私钥保留在此设备的钥匙串中，不会同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請將此金鑰加入主機上的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys，例如在主機上執行拷貝的安裝指令。私密金鑰保留在此裝置的鑰匙圈中，不會同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
