    "Paste an OpenSSH Ed25519 private key (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). A passphrase-protected key from a current ssh-keygen uses 24 bcrypt rounds, more than Minis can read (17 at most): re-encrypt a copy with fewer rounds first, using ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <copy of the key>." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Füge einen privaten OpenSSH-Ed25519-Schlüssel ein (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Ein mit Passphrase geschützter Schlüssel aus einem aktuellen ssh-keygen nutzt 24 bcrypt-Runden, mehr als Minis lesen kann (höchstens 17): Verschlüssele zuerst eine Kopie mit weniger Runden neu, mit ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <Kopie des Schlüssels>."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paste an OpenSSH Ed25519 private key (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). A passphrase-protected key from a current ssh-keygen uses 24 bcrypt rounds, more than Minis can read (17 at most): re-encrypt a copy with fewer rounds first, using ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <copy of the key>."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pega una clave privada OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Una clave protegida con frase de contraseña de un ssh-keygen actual usa 24 rondas de bcrypt, más de las que Minis puede leer (17 como máximo): primero vuelve a cifrar una copia con menos rondas usando ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <copia de la clave>."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mag-paste ng OpenSSH Ed25519 private key (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Gumagamit ng 24 bcrypt round ang key na may passphrase mula sa kasalukuyang ssh-keygen, higit sa kayang basahin ng Minis (17 ang pinakamarami): i-encrypt muna ulit ang isang kopya na may mas kaunting round gamit ang ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <kopya ng key>."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Collez une clé privée OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Une clé protégée par phrase secrète créée par un ssh-keygen récent utilise 24 tours bcrypt, plus que Minis ne peut en lire (17 au maximum) : rechiffrez d’abord une copie avec moins de tours, avec ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <copie de la clé>."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zalijepite privatni ključ OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Ključ zaštićen zaporkom iz trenutačnog ssh-keygena koristi 24 bcrypt runde, više nego što Minis može pročitati (najviše 17): najprije ponovno šifrirajte kopiju s manje rundi pomoću ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <kopija ključa>."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tempel kunci privat OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Kunci yang dilindungi frasa sandi dari ssh-keygen saat ini memakai 24 putaran bcrypt, lebih dari yang dapat dibaca Minis (maksimal 17): enkripsi ulang salinannya dulu dengan putaran lebih sedikit, memakai ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <salinan kunci>."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenSSH Ed25519 秘密鍵（BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY）を貼り付けてください。現在の ssh-keygen でパスフレーズを付けた鍵は 24 回の bcrypt ラウンドを使い、Minis が読み取れる上限（17）を超えます。先に ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <鍵のコピー> でラウンド数を減らしてコピーを再暗号化してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenSSH Ed25519 개인 키(BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY)를 붙여 넣으세요. 최신 ssh-keygen에서 암호 구문으로 보호한 키는 bcrypt 라운드를 24회 사용해 Minis가 읽을 수 있는 한도(최대 17)를 넘습니다. 먼저 ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <키 사본>으로 라운드를 줄여 사본을 다시 암호화하세요."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tampal kunci peribadi OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Kunci yang dilindungi frasa laluan daripada ssh-keygen semasa menggunakan 24 pusingan bcrypt, lebih daripada yang boleh dibaca oleh Minis (paling banyak 17): sulitkan semula salinan dengan pusingan yang lebih sedikit dahulu, menggunakan ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <salinan kunci>."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wklej klucz prywatny OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Klucz chroniony hasłem z obecnego ssh-keygen używa 24 rund bcrypt, więcej niż Minis potrafi odczytać (najwyżej 17): najpierw zaszyfruj ponownie kopię z mniejszą liczbą rund poleceniem ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <kopia klucza>."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cole uma chave privada OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Uma chave protegida por frase secreta de um ssh-keygen atual usa 24 rodadas de bcrypt, mais do que o Minis consegue ler (no máximo 17): antes, criptografe de novo uma cópia com menos rodadas usando ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <cópia da chave>."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lipiți o cheie privată OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). O cheie protejată cu frază de acces dintr-un ssh-keygen actual folosește 24 de runde bcrypt, mai multe decât poate citi Minis (cel mult 17): mai întâi recriptați o copie cu mai puține runde folosind ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <copia cheii>."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вставьте закрытый ключ OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Ключ, защищённый парольной фразой в современном ssh-keygen, использует 24 раунда bcrypt — больше, чем может прочитать Minis (не более 17): сначала перешифруйте копию с меньшим числом раундов командой ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <копия ключа>."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "วางคีย์ส่วนตัว OpenSSH Ed25519 (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY) คีย์ที่ป้องกันด้วยวลีรหัสผ่านจาก ssh-keygen ปัจจุบันใช้ bcrypt 24 รอบ มากกว่าที่ Minis อ่านได้ (สูงสุด 17): ให้เข้ารหัสสำเนาใหม่ด้วยรอบที่น้อยลงก่อน โดยใช้ ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <สำเนาคีย์>"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bir OpenSSH Ed25519 özel anahtarı yapıştırın (BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY). Güncel bir ssh-keygen ile parolayla korunan anahtar 24 bcrypt turu kullanır; bu, Minis'in okuyabileceğinden fazladır (en çok 17): Önce ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <anahtarın kopyası> ile bir kopyayı daha az turla yeniden şifreleyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请粘贴 OpenSSH Ed25519 私钥（BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY）。当前 ssh-keygen 生成的带密码短语的密钥使用 24 轮 bcrypt，超过 Minis 能读取的上限（最多 17 轮）：请先用 ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <密钥副本> 以较少的轮数重新加密一份副本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請貼上 OpenSSH Ed25519 私密金鑰（BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY）。目前的 ssh-keygen 產生的有密碼短語的金鑰使用 24 回合 bcrypt，超過 Minis 能讀取的上限（最多 17 回合）：請先用 ssh-keygen -p -a 16 -f <金鑰副本> 以較少的回合數重新加密一份副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
