    "“%@” presented a different host key (%@), so the connection was refused. If the host was reinstalled, check the new fingerprint and trust it in Settings → Remote Hosts → %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ hat einen anderen Host-Schlüssel gezeigt (%@), daher wurde die Verbindung abgelehnt. Wenn der Host neu installiert wurde, prüfe den neuen Fingerabdruck und vertraue ihm in Einstellungen → Remote-Hosts → %@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” presented a different host key (%@), so the connection was refused. If the host was reinstalled, check the new fingerprint and trust it in Settings → Remote Hosts → %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” presentó una clave de host distinta (%@), así que se rechazó la conexión. Si el host se reinstaló, comprueba la nueva huella y confía en ella en Ajustes → Hosts remotos → %@."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nagpakita ang “%@” ng ibang host key (%@), kaya tinanggihan ang koneksyon. Kung na-reinstall ang host, tingnan ang bagong fingerprint at pagkatiwalaan ito sa Settings → Mga Remote Host → %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "« %@ » a présenté une autre clé d’hôte (%@), la connexion a donc été refusée. Si l’hôte a été réinstallé, vérifiez la nouvelle empreinte et faites-lui confiance dans Réglages → Hôtes distants → %@."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@” je pokazao drugačiji ključ hosta (%@), pa je veza odbijena. Ako je host ponovno instaliran, provjerite novi otisak i označite ga kao pouzdan u Postavke → Udaljeni hostovi → %@."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” menunjukkan kunci host yang berbeda (%@), jadi koneksi ditolak. Jika host diinstal ulang, periksa sidik jari baru dan percayai di Pengaturan → Host Jarak Jauh → %@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” が別のホスト鍵（%@）を提示したため、接続を拒否しました。ホストを再インストールした場合は、新しいフィンガープリントを確認し、設定 → リモートホスト → %@ で信頼してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”이(가) 다른 호스트 키(%@)를 제시해 연결이 거부되었습니다. 호스트를 다시 설치했다면 새 지문을 확인하고 설정 → 원격 호스트 → %@에서 신뢰하세요."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” menunjukkan kunci hos yang berbeza (%@), jadi sambungan ditolak. Jika hos dipasang semula, semak cap jari baharu dan percayainya dalam Tetapan → Hos Jauh → %@."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@” przedstawił inny klucz hosta (%@), więc połączenie zostało odrzucone. Jeśli host przeinstalowano, sprawdź nowy odcisk i zaufaj mu w Ustawienia → Hosty zdalne → %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” apresentou uma chave de host diferente (%@), então a conexão foi recusada. Se o host foi reinstalado, confira a nova impressão digital e confie nela em Ajustes → Hosts remotos → %@."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@” a prezentat o altă cheie de gazdă (%@), așa că conexiunea a fost refuzată. Dacă gazda a fost reinstalată, verificați noua amprentă și marcați-o ca de încredere în Configurări → Gazde la distanță → %@."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» предъявил другой ключ хоста (%@), поэтому подключение отклонено. Если хост переустанавливали, проверьте новый отпечаток и доверьтесь ему в Настройки → Удалённые хосты → %@."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” แสดงคีย์โฮสต์ที่ต่างไป (%@) จึงปฏิเสธการเชื่อมต่อ หากติดตั้งโฮสต์ใหม่ ให้ตรวจสอบลายนิ้วมือใหม่และเชื่อถือคีย์ใน การตั้งค่า → โฮสต์ระยะไกล → %@"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” farklı bir ana makine anahtarı sundu (%@), bu yüzden bağlantı reddedildi. Ana makine yeniden kurulduysa yeni parmak izini denetleyin ve Ayarlar → Uzak Ana Makineler → %@ bölümünde ona güvenin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”出示了不同的主机密钥（%@），因此连接被拒绝。如果主机已重装，请核对新的指纹，然后在“设置 → 远程主机 → %@”中信任它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」出示了不同的主機金鑰（%@），因此連線被拒絕。如果主機已重新安裝，請核對新的指紋，然後在「設定 → 遠端主機 → %@」中信任它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” presented a different host key from the one you trusted. This is expected after the host was reinstalled or its SSH keys were regenerated. Otherwise someone may be intercepting the connection: do not trust the new key until you know why it changed." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ hat einen anderen Host-Schlüssel gezeigt als den, dem du vertraut hast. Das ist normal, wenn der Host neu installiert oder seine SSH-Schlüssel neu erzeugt wurden. Andernfalls könnte jemand die Verbindung abfangen: Vertraue dem neuen Schlüssel erst, wenn du weißt, warum er sich geändert hat."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” presented a different host key from the one you trusted. This is expected after the host was reinstalled or its SSH keys were regenerated. Otherwise someone may be intercepting the connection: do not trust the new key until you know why it changed."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” presentó una clave de host distinta de la que confiaste. Es normal si el host se reinstaló o se regeneraron sus claves SSH. Si no, alguien podría estar interceptando la conexión: no confíes en la nueva clave hasta saber por qué cambió."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nagpakita ang “%@” ng host key na iba sa pinagkatiwalaan mo. Inaasahan ito kung na-reinstall ang host o ginawang muli ang mga SSH key nito. Kung hindi, baka may humaharang sa koneksyon: huwag pagkatiwalaan ang bagong key hangga't hindi mo alam kung bakit ito nagbago."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "« %@ » a présenté une clé d’hôte différente de celle que vous avez approuvée. C’est normal si l’hôte a été réinstallé ou si ses clés SSH ont été régénérées. Sinon, quelqu’un intercepte peut-être la connexion : n’approuvez pas la nouvelle clé avant de savoir pourquoi elle a changé."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@” je pokazao ključ hosta koji se razlikuje od onoga kojem vjerujete. To je očekivano ako je host ponovno instaliran ili su mu SSH ključevi ponovno generirani. U suprotnom netko možda presreće vezu: ne vjerujte novom ključu dok ne saznate zašto se promijenio."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” menunjukkan kunci host yang berbeda dari yang Anda percayai. Ini wajar jika host diinstal ulang atau kunci SSH-nya dibuat ulang. Jika tidak, mungkin ada yang menyadap koneksi: jangan percayai kunci baru sebelum Anda tahu mengapa kunci itu berubah."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” が、信頼済みのものとは異なるホスト鍵を提示しました。ホストを再インストールしたか SSH 鍵を作り直した場合は想定どおりです。そうでない場合は接続が傍受されている可能性があります。変更された理由がわかるまで新しい鍵を信頼しないでください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”이(가) 신뢰한 키와 다른 호스트 키를 제시했습니다. 호스트를 다시 설치했거나 SSH 키를 다시 생성했다면 정상입니다. 그렇지 않다면 누군가 연결을 가로채고 있을 수 있으니, 키가 바뀐 이유를 알기 전에는 새 키를 신뢰하지 마세요."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” menunjukkan kunci hos yang berbeza daripada yang anda percayai. Ini dijangka jika hos dipasang semula atau kunci SSH-nya dijana semula. Jika tidak, mungkin ada pihak yang memintas sambungan: jangan percayai kunci baharu sehingga anda tahu sebab ia berubah."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@” przedstawił inny klucz hosta niż ten, któremu zaufano. To normalne, jeśli host przeinstalowano lub wygenerowano od nowa jego klucze SSH. W przeciwnym razie ktoś może przechwytywać połączenie: nie ufaj nowemu kluczowi, dopóki nie wiadomo, dlaczego się zmienił."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” apresentou uma chave de host diferente da que você confiou. Isso é esperado se o host foi reinstalado ou se as chaves SSH dele foram geradas de novo. Caso contrário, alguém pode estar interceptando a conexão: não confie na nova chave até saber por que ela mudou."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@” a prezentat o cheie de gazdă diferită de cea în care aveți încredere. Este normal dacă gazda a fost reinstalată sau cheile ei SSH au fost regenerate. Altfel, cineva ar putea intercepta conexiunea: nu aveți încredere în noua cheie până nu aflați de ce s-a schimbat."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» предъявил ключ хоста, отличный от того, которому вы доверились. Это ожидаемо, если хост переустанавливали или его SSH-ключи создали заново. Иначе кто-то может перехватывать подключение: не доверяйте новому ключу, пока не выясните, почему он изменился."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” แสดงคีย์โฮสต์ที่ต่างจากคีย์ที่คุณเชื่อถือ ซึ่งเป็นเรื่องปกติหากติดตั้งโฮสต์ใหม่หรือสร้างคีย์ SSH ใหม่ มิฉะนั้นอาจมีคนดักการเชื่อมต่ออยู่ อย่าเชื่อถือคีย์ใหม่จนกว่าจะรู้ว่าทำไมคีย์จึงเปลี่ยน"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” güvendiğiniz anahtardan farklı bir ana makine anahtarı sundu. Ana makine yeniden kurulduysa veya SSH anahtarları yeniden oluşturulduysa bu beklenen bir durumdur. Aksi takdirde biri bağlantıyı dinliyor olabilir: Neden değiştiğini öğrenene kadar yeni anahtara güvenmeyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”出示的主机密钥与你信任的不同。如果主机已重装或重新生成了 SSH 密钥，这是正常的。否则可能有人正在截获连接：在弄清密钥为何变化之前，请不要信任新密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」出示的主機金鑰與你信任的不同。如果主機已重新安裝或重新產生了 SSH 金鑰，這是正常的。否則可能有人正在攔截連線：在弄清金鑰為何改變之前，請不要信任新金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” rejected this device's SSH key. Add the key shown under Public Key in Settings → Remote Hosts → %@ to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys on the host." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ hat den SSH-Schlüssel dieses Geräts abgelehnt. Füge den unter „Öffentlicher Schlüssel“ in Einstellungen → Remote-Hosts → %@ angezeigten Schlüssel zu ~/.ssh/authorized_keys auf dem Host hinzu."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” rejected this device's SSH key. Add the key shown under Public Key in Settings → Remote Hosts → %@ to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys on the host."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” rechazó la clave SSH de este dispositivo. Añade la clave que aparece en Clave pública en Ajustes → Hosts remotos → %@ a ~/.ssh/authorized_keys en el host."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tinanggihan ng “%@” ang SSH key ng device na ito. Idagdag ang key na nasa Public Key sa Settings → Mga Remote Host → %@ sa ~/.ssh/authorized_keys ng host."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "« %@ » a refusé la clé SSH de cet appareil. Ajoutez la clé affichée sous Clé publique dans Réglages → Hôtes distants → %@ à ~/.ssh/authorized_keys sur l’hôte."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@” je odbio SSH ključ ovog uređaja. Dodajte ključ prikazan pod Javni ključ u Postavke → Udaljeni hostovi → %@ u ~/.ssh/authorized_keys na hostu."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” menolak kunci SSH perangkat ini. Tambahkan kunci yang ditampilkan di Kunci Publik pada Pengaturan → Host Jarak Jauh → %@ ke ~/.ssh/authorized_keys di host."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” がこのデバイスの SSH 鍵を拒否しました。設定 → リモートホスト → %@ の「公開鍵」に表示されている鍵を、ホストの ~/.ssh/authorized_keys に追加してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”이(가) 이 기기의 SSH 키를 거부했습니다. 설정 → 원격 호스트 → %@의 공개 키에 표시된 키를 호스트의 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys에 추가하세요."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” menolak kunci SSH peranti ini. Tambah kunci yang ditunjukkan di bawah Kunci Awam dalam Tetapan → Hos Jauh → %@ ke ~/.ssh/authorized_keys pada hos."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@” odrzucił klucz SSH tego urządzenia. Dodaj klucz widoczny w sekcji Klucz publiczny w Ustawienia → Hosty zdalne → %@ do ~/.ssh/authorized_keys na hoście."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” recusou a chave SSH deste dispositivo. Adicione a chave mostrada em Chave pública em Ajustes → Hosts remotos → %@ a ~/.ssh/authorized_keys no host."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@” a refuzat cheia SSH a acestui dispozitiv. Adăugați cheia afișată la Cheie publică în Configurări → Gazde la distanță → %@ în ~/.ssh/authorized_keys pe gazdă."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» отклонил SSH-ключ этого устройства. Добавьте ключ из раздела «Открытый ключ» в Настройки → Удалённые хосты → %@ в ~/.ssh/authorized_keys на хосте."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” ปฏิเสธคีย์ SSH ของอุปกรณ์นี้ ให้เพิ่มคีย์ที่แสดงใต้คีย์สาธารณะใน การตั้งค่า → โฮสต์ระยะไกล → %@ ลงใน ~/.ssh/authorized_keys บนโฮสต์"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” bu aygıtın SSH anahtarını reddetti. Ayarlar → Uzak Ana Makineler → %@ bölümünde Ortak Anahtar altında gösterilen anahtarı ana makinedeki ~/.ssh/authorized_keys dosyasına ekleyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@”拒绝了此设备的 SSH 密钥。请将“设置 → 远程主机 → %@”中“公钥”下显示的密钥添加到主机上的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」拒絕了此裝置的 SSH 金鑰。請將「設定 → 遠端主機 → %@」中「公開金鑰」下顯示的金鑰加入主機上的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys。"
          }
        }
      }
